    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d695">

                <pb facs="0905" n="809" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg809"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Cambon to Mr.
                            Day.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Embassy of the French Republic</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-08-29"><hi rendition="#italic">August 29,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The French embassy has been requested to inform the Federal Government that the
                    families of the officers of the garrison of the archipelago of the Ladrones are
                    in a state of entire destitution.</p>
                <p>The Spanish Government is confident that as soon as the attention of the
                    Department of State has been called to this painful situation the United States
                    will act in accordance with the feelings of humanity and the responsibility
                    which it has assumed in sending those officers to Manila, and will take the
                    necessary steps to have their families sent to Cavite.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
